#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAnimatedSlewing), group (View)
#: rc.cpp:5269
msgid ""
"If true, focus changes will cause the sky to visibly spin to the new "
"position.  Otherwise, the display will \"snap\" instantly to the new "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Se se sinala esta opción, a alteración da posición do foco fai que o ceo "
"xire visibelmente cara a nova posición. Caso contrario, a nova posición será "
"visíbel instantaneamente."

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:238
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FOVNames), group (View)
